---
description: Prefer open-source flat icons over emoji in UI
alwaysApply: true
---

# Iconography Preference

- Use open-source flat icon sets (for example Font Awesome or Lucide) for UI iconography.
- Do not introduce emoji characters or HTML emoji entities for interface icons.
- When replacing existing emoji icons, preserve semantic meaning (for example, compliance, database, support, navigation arrows).
- Keep icons decorative unless they convey unique meaning; use `aria-hidden="true"` for decorative icons.
